{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://project-management-grounding/contracts/schema/runtime-config.schema.json",
  "title": "运行期配置实例（<project>/config.json）",
  "description": "配置层的结构 schema，依据 spec/D6_REBASELINE_PROPOSAL.md 第 9 节（9.1 位置与边界、9.2 配置项清单与责任方裁定的 CFG-14/CFG-15、9.3 缺失与非法值、9.4 配置快照）。它约束的是**项目参数的取值形状**，不执行任何判定求值。四类归属只有 project_parameter 能出现在本文件：skill_criterion、acceptance_parameter、capability_switch 由 propertyNames 与 additionalProperties 双重拒绝，不得混写。默认值规则：只有非判定性项允许默认值（CFG-10、CFG-11），判定性项一律无默认，缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3），不得回落为通过。四条安全边界见顶层 $comment，其中“配置只能调严或调宽、不得关闭检查”的机械落点是本 schema 不含任何 enable/disable/skip/ignore/waive 类字段，且每一层 additionalProperties 均为 false——没有字段可以关闭某个 check。",
  "$comment": "schema_version=config.schema/1; classes=project_parameter|skill_criterion|acceptance_parameter|capability_switch; present_class=project_parameter; 每个 CFG 属性的 $comment 以 cfg=/class=/defaultable=/absent= 元数据登记，不设子字段默认值例外（判定性项的任何层级都不得出现 default）。安全边界：B1 缺配置不得默认通过（defaultable=false ⇒ 无 default ⇒ absent=cannot_evaluate）；B2 人审关口不可删除（CFG-12 只有 additional_gates 与 approver_role_map，删除表达不存在）；B3 检查项不可关闭（无任何开关字段）；B4 配置不可改变工件必填字段集合（本文件只约束取值，不出现 required 列表注入工件）。",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema_version",
    "config"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "type": "string",
      "const": "config.schema/1",
      "maxLength": 40,
      "description": "配置 schema 版本。与 config.lock.json 的 schema_version 必须一致；不一致按 config_drift（退出码 1）处理。"
    },
    "project_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]{0,63}$",
      "maxLength": 64,
      "description": "项目标识。用于工件命名与配置快照归属；不参与判定语义。"
    },
    "config": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "propertyNames": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^CFG-(0[1-9]|1[0-5])$",
        "maxLength": 8
      },
      "required": [
        "CFG-01",
        "CFG-02",
        "CFG-03",
        "CFG-04",
        "CFG-09"
      ],
      "description": "配置项集合。键只允许 CFG-01～CFG-15；任何未注册键（含 SKILL-*、ACCEPT-*、SWITCH-* 前缀）按 config_invalid（退出码 2）处理，防止拼写错误被当成新参数。",
      "properties": {
        "CFG-01": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-01; class=project_parameter; defaultable=false; absent=cannot_evaluate",
          "title": "偏差分档维度",
          "description": "偏差按哪些对象维度分档。至少 1 项，取值必须来自封闭枚举。判定性：缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3），不取默认。",
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 4,
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "cost_account",
              "wbs_node",
              "deliverable",
              "work_package"
            ],
            "maxLength": 40
          }
        },
        "CFG-02": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-02; class=project_parameter; defaultable=false; absent=cannot_evaluate",
          "title": "分档数与状态标签",
          "description": "档数 3–5，标签与档数等长且取值封闭。判定性：缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3）。等长约束由下方 if/then 机械校验，不依赖实现判断。",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "levels",
            "labels"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "levels": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 3,
              "maximum": 5
            },
            "labels": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 3,
              "maxItems": 5,
              "items": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "green",
                  "yellow",
                  "amber",
                  "red",
                  "blue"
                ],
                "maxLength": 16
              }
            }
          },
          "allOf": [
            {
              "if": {
                "properties": {
                  "levels": {
                    "const": 3
                  }
                }
              },
              "then": {
                "properties": {
                  "labels": {
                    "minItems": 3,
                    "maxItems": 3,
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "green",
                        "yellow",
                        "amber",
                        "red",
                        "blue"
                      ],
                      "maxLength": 16
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "if": {
                "properties": {
                  "levels": {
                    "const": 4
                  }
                }
              },
              "then": {
                "properties": {
                  "labels": {
                    "minItems": 4,
                    "maxItems": 4,
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "green",
                        "yellow",
                        "amber",
                        "red",
                        "blue"
                      ],
                      "maxLength": 16
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "if": {
                "properties": {
                  "levels": {
                    "const": 5
                  }
                }
              },
              "then": {
                "properties": {
                  "labels": {
                    "minItems": 5,
                    "maxItems": 5,
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "green",
                        "yellow",
                        "amber",
                        "red",
                        "blue"
                      ],
                      "maxLength": 16
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "CFG-03": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-03; class=project_parameter; defaultable=false; absent=cannot_evaluate",
          "title": "分档边界",
          "description": "分档边界须升序、无重叠、覆盖声明区间，并写明偏差点定义（SPI / CPI / 自定义）。形状与枚举由本 schema 校验；升序与覆盖性由配置解释器在求值时判定（本批不实现）。判定性：缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3）。",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "metric",
            "boundaries"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "metric": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "SPI",
                "CPI",
                "custom"
              ],
              "maxLength": 16
            },
            "custom_metric": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 0,
              "maxLength": 80
            },
            "boundaries": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 3,
              "maxItems": 5,
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "label",
                  "order",
                  "lower",
                  "upper"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "label": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "green",
                      "yellow",
                      "amber",
                      "red",
                      "blue"
                    ],
                    "maxLength": 16
                  },
                  "order": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "minimum": 1,
                    "maximum": 5
                  },
                  "lower": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "minimum": -1000000,
                    "maximum": 1000000
                  },
                  "upper": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "minimum": -1000000,
                    "maximum": 1000000
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "CFG-04": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-04; class=project_parameter; defaultable=false; absent=cannot_evaluate",
          "title": "采样口径",
          "description": "状态按里程碑周期分数、自然日、周、月或小时采样。判定性：缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3）。口径决定 CFG-05/CFG-06 或 CFG-07 的必填性，约束见顶层 allOf。",
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "milestone_fraction",
            "calendar_day",
            "week",
            "month",
            "hour"
          ],
          "maxLength": 32
        },
        "CFG-05": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-05; class=project_parameter; defaultable=false; absent=cannot_evaluate; must_include=1",
          "title": "里程碑周期分数采样集",
          "description": "分数 ∈ (0,1]、分母 ≤10、去重升序，必含 1（周期末必采）。本 schema 用 minimum 0.1 落实分母 ≤10 的下界；“必含 1”与去重升序由配置解释器在求值时判定。仅当 CFG-04=milestone_fraction 时必填，缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3）。",
          "type": "array",
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 10,
          "items": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0.1,
            "maximum": 1
          }
        },
        "CFG-06": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-06; class=project_parameter; defaultable=false; absent=cannot_evaluate",
          "title": "周期基准",
          "description": "决定 1/3 的分母是 5（工作日）还是 7（自然日）。必须显式，不得由实现猜。仅当 CFG-04=milestone_fraction 时必填，缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3）。",
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "workday",
            "calendar_day"
          ],
          "maxLength": 16
        },
        "CFG-07": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-07; class=project_parameter; defaultable=false; absent=cannot_evaluate",
          "title": "固定间隔采样",
          "description": "固定间隔采样的步长与单位。仅当 CFG-04 ∈ {calendar_day, week, month, hour} 时必填，缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3）。",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "n",
            "unit"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "n": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 365
            },
            "unit": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "day",
                "week",
                "month",
                "hour"
              ],
              "maxLength": 8
            }
          }
        },
        "CFG-08": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-08; class=project_parameter; defaultable=false; absent=cannot_evaluate",
          "title": "项目日历",
          "description": "工作日集合、节假日清单与 IANA 时区。判定性配置，无默认值；项缺失、timezone 或 workdays 缺失均判 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3）。",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "timezone",
            "workdays"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "timezone": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_+-]{0,63}(/[A-Za-z0-9_+-]{1,63}){0,2}$",
              "maxLength": 64
            },
            "workdays": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 1,
              "maxItems": 7,
              "items": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "Mon",
                  "Tue",
                  "Wed",
                  "Thu",
                  "Fri",
                  "Sat",
                  "Sun"
                ],
                "maxLength": 3
              }
            },
            "holidays": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 366,
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "from",
                  "to"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "from": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$",
                    "maxLength": 10
                  },
                  "to": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$",
                    "maxLength": 10
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "CFG-09": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-09; class=project_parameter; defaultable=false; absent=cannot_evaluate",
          "title": "货币",
          "description": "ISO 4217 三位币种码。判定性：缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3）。",
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[A-Z]{3}$",
          "maxLength": 3
        },
        "CFG-10": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-10; class=project_parameter; defaultable=true; absent=use_default",
          "title": "舍入口径",
          "description": "非判定性：缺失时取子字段默认值（2 位小数、half-even、中间计算不舍入），并在产物 config_used.defaulted 中登记 CFG-10。舍入会传导到 CPI/EAC，故跨配置不可比。",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "decimals": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 6,
              "default": 2
            },
            "rounding": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "half_up",
                "half_even"
              ],
              "maxLength": 16,
              "default": "half_even"
            },
            "intermediate": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "none",
                "4",
                "6"
              ],
              "maxLength": 8,
              "default": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "CFG-11": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-11; class=project_parameter; defaultable=true; absent=use_default",
          "title": "工件命名与版本约定",
          "description": "非判定性：缺失时取默认模板。模板必须含 <type> 段与 <major>/<minor> 版本段，由 pattern 机械校验。不影响任何可比性。",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "template": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^(?=.*<type>)(?=.*<major>)(?=.*<minor>)[^\\n]{1,200}$",
              "maxLength": 200,
              "default": "<type>-<project_id>-v<major>.<minor>"
            }
          }
        },
        "CFG-12": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-12; class=project_parameter; defaultable=false; absent=conservative_no_relaxation",
          "title": "人审关口",
          "description": "只能增加关口或映射 approver_role，不可移除任务卡声明的 mandatory gate——本 schema 不含任何删除表达，additionalProperties=false，故“删除关口”在结构上不可能。缺失时不增加额外关口（任务卡的 mandatory gate 仍全启用），角色未解析则 blocked；因此不取默认值、也不回落为通过。",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "additional_gates": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 20,
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "gate_id",
                  "approver_role"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "gate_id": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^GATE-[A-Z0-9_-]{1,40}$",
                    "maxLength": 48
                  },
                  "approver_role": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 80
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "approver_role_map": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 80
              },
              "maxProperties": 40,
              "propertyNames": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_.-]{1,80}$",
                "maxLength": 80
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "CFG-13": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-13; class=project_parameter; defaultable=false; absent=cannot_evaluate",
          "title": "挣值计量规则",
          "description": "挣值计量规则（0/100、50/50、百分比完成、加权里程碑）。判定性：用到挣值时必填，缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3）。公式、EAC 三法与术语别名属技能判据，不在本配置内。",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "rule"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "rule": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "0/100",
                "50/50",
                "percent_complete",
                "weighted_milestone"
              ],
              "maxLength": 24
            },
            "weighted_milestone_ref": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 0,
              "maxLength": 120
            }
          }
        },
        "CFG-14": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-14; class=project_parameter; defaultable=false; absent=cannot_evaluate",
          "title": "风险刻度",
          "description": "概率-影响刻度的尺寸、两维标签、评分规则与分档边界（批次 0084 由责任方裁定补号，承接 RG-08）。判定性：缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3），不取默认。标签数须与刻度尺寸一致（3x3 配 3 个标签，5x5 配 5 个）；分档边界的覆盖性与单调性由配置解释器在求值时判定。",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "scale",
            "probability_labels",
            "impact_labels",
            "score_rule",
            "bands"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "scale": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "3x3",
                "5x5"
              ],
              "maxLength": 8
            },
            "probability_labels": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 3,
              "maxItems": 5,
              "items": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 40
              }
            },
            "impact_labels": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 3,
              "maxItems": 5,
              "items": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 40
              }
            },
            "score_rule": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "product",
                "matrix"
              ],
              "maxLength": 16
            },
            "bands": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 3,
              "maxItems": 5,
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "label",
                  "order",
                  "lower",
                  "upper"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "label": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "enum": [
                      "green",
                      "yellow",
                      "amber",
                      "red",
                      "blue"
                    ],
                    "maxLength": 16
                  },
                  "order": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "minimum": 1,
                    "maximum": 5
                  },
                  "lower": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "minimum": 1,
                    "maximum": 25
                  },
                  "upper": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "minimum": 1,
                    "maximum": 25
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "CFG-15": {
          "$comment": "cfg=CFG-15; class=project_parameter; defaultable=false; absent=cannot_evaluate",
          "title": "成本科目表",
          "description": "组织成本科目表（科目编码、名称、上级科目）（批次 0084 由责任方裁定补号，承接 RG-07）。判定性：按 cost_account 维度分档或做成本汇总时必填，缺失即 cannot_evaluate（退出码 3）。编码唯一、上级科目存在且无环、科目与 WBS 的守恒关系由配置解释器在求值时判定。",
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "source",
            "accounts"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "source": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "maxLength": 120
            },
            "accounts": {
              "type": "array",
              "minItems": 1,
              "maxItems": 500,
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "required": [
                  "code",
                  "name"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "code": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^[A-Z0-9][A-Z0-9._-]{0,31}$",
                    "maxLength": 32
                  },
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1,
                    "maxLength": 80
                  },
                  "parent_code": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^[A-Z0-9][A-Z0-9._-]{0,31}$",
                    "maxLength": 32
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
